WEBVTT

00:00.980 --> 00:02.980
<b>Old AV Room</b>

00:02.150 --> 00:02.980
<b>Hey...</b>

00:03.220 --> 00:05.980
<b>How did you change yourself, Tomozaki?</b>

00:05.980 --> 00:06.610
<b>Me?</b>

00:06.850 --> 00:11.110
<b>I'm not good at, like, 
getting along with people.</b>

00:11.430 --> 00:14.400
<b>Well, in my case...</b>

00:15.040 --> 00:16.120
<b>Oh, right.</b>

00:16.330 --> 00:17.300
<b>Hang on a sec.</b>

00:18.460 --> 00:19.740
<b>Something wrong?</b>

00:19.970 --> 00:21.250
<b>Nothing.</b>

00:21.930 --> 00:27.250
<b>Um, in my case, I practiced my expressions, 
posture, and the way I talked.</b>

00:28.310 --> 00:30.710
<b>In the past, I didn't emote much,</b>

00:31.130 --> 00:32.590
<b>I slouched all the time,</b>

00:32.590 --> 00:34.720
<b>and I always mumbled.</b>

00:35.180 --> 00:37.470
<b>The epitome of socially awkward.</b>

00:37.680 --> 00:42.480
<b>But you sound so cheerful now, 
and your whole vibe has changed.</b>

00:43.420 --> 00:45.730
<b>Oh... you think so?</b>

00:46.310 --> 00:48.240
<b>Still got a weird way of 
getting embarrassed, though!</b>

00:48.240 --> 00:50.940
<b>I haven't worked on that yet...</b>

00:51.590 --> 00:56.820
<b>But I think the very first thing you should 
do is figure out exactly where you are.</b>

00:57.110 --> 00:58.610
<b>Where I am?</b>

00:59.170 --> 01:00.330
<b>What do you mean?</b>

01:01.840 --> 01:02.950
<b>Well, you see...</b>

01:03.530 --> 01:06.310
<b>You still <i>laugh</i> weird, too! 
It's creepy!</b>

01:06.310 --> 01:07.960
<b>I have to agree...</b>

01:08.480 --> 01:10.460
<b>Okay, that should be enough.</b>

01:10.880 --> 01:12.460
<b><i>Still got a weird way of 
getting embarrassed, though!</i></b>

01:12.460 --> 01:14.720
<b><i>I haven't worked on that yet...</i></b>

01:14.720 --> 01:17.440
<b><i>But I think the very 
first thing you should do</i></b>

01:15.110 --> 01:16.590
<b>Hey! I've been bugged!</b>

01:16.810 --> 01:20.100
<b>Wait—just listen. Tama, c'mon—</b>

01:17.440 --> 01:20.100
<b><i>is figure out exactly where you are.</i></b>

01:20.400 --> 01:23.030
<b><i>Where I am?
What do you mean?</i></b>

01:24.210 --> 01:25.500
<b><i>Well, you see...</i></b>

01:25.500 --> 01:28.350
<b><i>You still </i>laugh<i> weird, too! 
It's creepy!</i></b>

01:28.780 --> 01:30.060
<b>How was that?</b>

01:30.060 --> 01:32.210
<b>I'm pretty harsh, huh?</b>

01:32.210 --> 01:33.070
<b>Right!</b>

01:33.070 --> 01:37.130
<b>The way a person talks might not 
be exactly how they picture it.</b>

01:38.480 --> 01:43.900
<b>Once you know how you talk, maybe you'll 
figure out how you can change it.</b>

01:43.900 --> 01:44.750
<b>Maybe so...</b>

01:45.590 --> 01:48.420
<b>Okay! I'll give it my best shot!</b>

03:19.300 --> 03:22.840
<b>2nd Stage: Lv. 3 
Battles are better when you're against someone
 whose signature move is the opposite of yours</b>

03:20.140 --> 03:20.970
<b>Okay,</b>

03:20.970 --> 03:22.840
<b>lift the corners of your mouth.</b>

03:25.140 --> 03:27.470
<b>Now run through the vowels.</b>

03:30.240 --> 03:32.870
<b>Okay! See how that feels?</b>

03:32.870 --> 03:33.480
<b>Uh-huh!</b>

03:33.480 --> 03:36.230
<b>You catch on quick. That's our Tama!</b>

03:36.640 --> 03:37.820
<b>Yay!</b>

03:38.430 --> 03:40.320
<b>Think you can practice on your own?</b>

03:40.810 --> 03:41.760
<b>Woo!</b>

03:42.520 --> 03:46.540
<b>You're <i>really</i> good. Better than me, even.</b>

03:46.540 --> 03:47.240
<b>Eh?!</b>

03:47.240 --> 03:49.030
<b>You're fully proficient.</b>

03:49.030 --> 03:51.440
<b>Hey! You haven't taught me anything yet!</b>

03:51.440 --> 03:55.580
<b>Yeah, but... your basic 
ability is <i>way</i> beyond mine.</b>

03:55.820 --> 03:58.240
<b>I don't think your expressions 
or the way you talk</b>

03:58.240 --> 04:01.220
<b>are what's keeping you from 
getting along in class.</b>

04:01.220 --> 04:03.840
<b>Then what could it be?</b>

04:04.160 --> 04:05.510
<b>Hmm...</b>

04:05.510 --> 04:10.740
<b>Maybe try not arguing 
with Konno for a while?</b>

04:13.250 --> 04:14.200
<b>Got it.</b>

04:15.590 --> 04:16.610
<b>Tama!</b>

04:16.610 --> 04:18.340
<b>Sorry I kept you!</b>

04:18.830 --> 04:19.360
<b>Hey...</b>

04:19.650 --> 04:21.120
<b>Tomozaki, too?</b>

04:21.120 --> 04:23.070
<b>What? Why?</b>

04:23.070 --> 04:25.740
<b>Um, well... this and that...</b>

04:25.740 --> 04:27.370
<b>Aoi's not with you?</b>

04:27.680 --> 04:31.120
<b>She'll have her hands full with 
student council stuff for a while.</b>

04:31.690 --> 04:32.680
<b>So, Brain,</b>

04:32.680 --> 04:35.250
<b>what exactly is going on here, hmm?</b>

04:35.250 --> 04:36.880
<b>Oh... er...</b>

04:36.880 --> 04:38.880
<b>It-It's just...</b>

04:42.130 --> 04:44.630
<b>Sewing Room 2</b>

04:44.310 --> 04:47.640
<b>You're dead set against changing Tama, right?</b>

04:48.190 --> 04:51.270
<b>I told you, didn't I? There's nothing 
wrong with Tama.</b>

04:51.270 --> 04:53.590
<b>So she <i>shouldn't</i> change.</b>

04:54.250 --> 04:56.770
<b>Even if she <i>wants</i> to?</b>

04:58.390 --> 04:59.700
<b>That's what she told me:</b>

05:00.190 --> 05:04.400
<b>the situation is making Mimimi sad, 
so she wants to change herself.</b>

05:04.890 --> 05:07.360
<b>That's what <i>she</i> wants to 
do—loud and clear.</b>

05:08.930 --> 05:09.740
<b>I see.</b>

05:09.740 --> 05:13.290
<b>I'd like you to help her, if 
it's possible.</b>

05:14.120 --> 05:17.920
<b>If Hanabi changes, none of this matters.</b>

05:19.820 --> 05:20.920
<b>Hinami...</b>

05:22.510 --> 05:23.420
<b>On that day,</b>

05:23.420 --> 05:26.300
<b>the mood in the classroom shifted a little.</b>

05:29.650 --> 05:33.560
<b>This had always been where Konno and 
Tama would start up their squabbling,</b>

05:34.560 --> 05:37.560
<b>and the class's mood would take a nosedive.</b>

05:44.490 --> 05:45.640
<b>Yes!</b>

05:49.030 --> 05:51.030
<b>Old AV Room</b>

05:50.480 --> 05:53.870
<b>Great job, Tama! You really 
restrained yourself.</b>

05:53.870 --> 05:55.540
<b>Uh-huh. It's frustrating,</b>

05:55.970 --> 05:58.540
<b>but I know there are more 
important things.</b>

05:58.840 --> 06:02.480
<b>At this rate, though, things 
might not get worse,</b>

06:02.480 --> 06:05.540
<b>but they won't get dramatically 
better, either.</b>

06:05.540 --> 06:07.300
<b>Yeah... I guess not.</b>

06:07.600 --> 06:15.430
<b>Now to create an atmosphere that'll make 
the rest of the class take your side.</b>

06:17.540 --> 06:20.940
<b>I just don't know what they're all thinking.</b>

06:21.600 --> 06:25.260
<b>I kinda know what Konno is thinking, but...</b>

06:25.260 --> 06:28.570
<b>The rest of the class? It's a 
total mystery.</b>

06:28.840 --> 06:30.540
<b>Right...</b>

06:30.540 --> 06:33.750
<b>"Mood" and "flow" sure are tough.</b>

06:33.750 --> 06:34.960
<b>For you, too?</b>

06:34.960 --> 06:38.380
<b>I've started to understand 
them a little lately,</b>

06:38.380 --> 06:41.210
<b>but it took me about five 
months to get to this point.</b>

06:41.550 --> 06:44.840
<b>We probably don't have that kind of time.</b>

06:45.160 --> 06:45.940
<b>Right.</b>

06:46.360 --> 06:49.910
<b>We need some kind of big game-changing move</b>

06:49.910 --> 06:53.030
<b>that'll flip everything on its 
head in a short span of time.</b>

06:53.030 --> 06:54.600
<b>But we'll need help.</b>

06:57.100 --> 07:00.730
<b>Well, well, you two! In a 
bit of a pinch, are you?</b>

07:01.020 --> 07:02.180
<b>Mizusawa?</b>

07:04.980 --> 07:07.990
<b>I knew it, Fumiya.</b>

07:08.300 --> 07:10.950
<b>You <i>are</i> secretly up to something, after all.</b>

07:11.230 --> 07:13.010
<b>Wh-What do you mean?</b>

07:13.010 --> 07:17.300
<b>I thought you two might be scheming, 
so I kept an eye on you.</b>

07:17.300 --> 07:19.760
<b>This is about Erika's harassment, isn't it?</b>

07:19.760 --> 07:22.810
<b>Uh... yes. It is, actually.</b>

07:22.810 --> 07:24.620
<b>Hit the nail on the head!</b>

07:26.010 --> 07:28.210
<b>You been holding up okay?</b>

07:28.640 --> 07:30.090
<b>I'm fine.</b>

07:30.610 --> 07:33.890
<b>Oh, am I a third wheel here?</b>

07:34.230 --> 07:35.760
<b>It's not that.</b>

07:36.510 --> 07:39.810
<b>Wait, did you specifically drop 
by to see how we were doing?</b>

07:40.260 --> 07:41.190
<b>Eh, you know.</b>

07:41.630 --> 07:43.680
<b>If you're going to stand up to Erika,</b>

07:43.680 --> 07:47.320
<b>shouldn't you have a slightly shady 
character like me in the mix?</b>

07:50.080 --> 07:50.820
<b>Say...</b>

07:51.120 --> 07:55.440
<b>You and Nakamura don't really 
get along with Tama, do you?</b>

07:55.440 --> 07:57.150
<b>And there it is.</b>

07:57.150 --> 07:59.430
<b>Well, she's like you—so that's good.</b>

07:59.430 --> 07:59.950
<b>See...</b>

08:00.560 --> 08:03.150
<b>Tama won't bend, right?</b>

08:03.640 --> 08:08.410
<b>And Shuji and Erika are both boss types, 
so they're like oil and water with her.</b>

08:08.410 --> 08:13.490
<b>They had this huge blow-up fight 
and dragged me and Takei into it...</b>

08:14.060 --> 08:19.220
<b>I took Shuji's side, so I can see 
why I'd come off badly to her.</b>

08:21.580 --> 08:22.520
<b>So... yeah.</b>

08:22.520 --> 08:24.770
<b>Anyway, if you need any help,</b>

08:24.770 --> 08:26.870
<b>I'll be around.</b>

08:27.340 --> 08:28.030
<b>Later.</b>

08:30.820 --> 08:32.570
<b>Hang on, Mizusawa!</b>

08:34.320 --> 08:36.700
<b>I know what we have to do first!</b>

08:37.320 --> 08:39.200
<b>Tama, as of today, your task will be...</b>

08:39.760 --> 08:42.700
<b>"Make friends with Mizusawa"!</b>

08:44.960 --> 08:46.960
<b>Bottom-Tier Character Tomozaki S2</b>

08:46.960 --> 08:48.960
<b>Old AV Room</b>

08:47.680 --> 08:48.960
<b>Aha...</b>

08:48.960 --> 08:52.150
<b>Practice for getting along with 
the rest of the class, eh?</b>

08:52.150 --> 08:55.000
<b>And you want me to be her study partner.</b>

08:55.430 --> 08:56.090
<b>Yeah.</b>

08:56.440 --> 08:59.360
<b>I think one reason she can't 
integrate herself well</b>

08:59.360 --> 09:03.600
<b>has to do with putting up emotional 
barriers and becoming unbendable.</b>

09:03.600 --> 09:08.410
<b>This could be the first step 
to cracking that shell.</b>

09:08.410 --> 09:12.490
<b>Okay. I'll lend a hand—for you, Fumiya.</b>

09:12.490 --> 09:14.250
<b>The rest is up to Tama.</b>

09:17.420 --> 09:19.320
<b>I'll give it a shot!</b>

09:22.900 --> 09:26.000
<b>We've never properly talked 
like this, have we?</b>

09:26.000 --> 09:27.410
<b>You're right...</b>

09:27.410 --> 09:30.250
<b>Do you hate me like you hate Shuji?</b>

09:30.250 --> 09:34.760
<b>I've seen you hanging out with Nakamura and 
saying a lot of mean things about me.</b>

09:36.510 --> 09:38.890
<b>Is that so... Mean things, huh.</b>

09:38.890 --> 09:41.890
<b>I don't like that, so I've been avoiding you.</b>

09:41.890 --> 09:43.240
<b>Avoiding—</b>

09:44.710 --> 09:45.570
<b>Huh.</b>

09:46.080 --> 09:49.240
<b>Hey, Fumiya, she's got you beat 
in the bluntness department.</b>

09:49.240 --> 09:51.230
<b>You ain't seen nothin' yet.</b>

09:51.230 --> 09:52.780
<b>Seriously?</b>

09:53.200 --> 09:56.490
<b>Okay, so... it does sound 
like you hate me, then.</b>

09:56.780 --> 09:59.330
<b>But, I mean, I can't know 
what kind of person you are</b>

09:59.330 --> 10:00.740
<b>if I don't try talking to you first.</b>

10:01.020 --> 10:06.250
<b>Hmm. In that case, is there 
anything you want to ask me?</b>

10:06.800 --> 10:08.080
<b>Not really.</b>

10:09.840 --> 10:11.110
<b>I had a feeling.</b>

10:11.110 --> 10:14.530
<b>Oh—there <i>is</i> one thing I've wondered about.</b>

10:14.530 --> 10:15.840
<b>Yeah? Hit me.</b>

10:16.100 --> 10:18.340
<b>Do you like Aoi?</b>

10:18.740 --> 10:19.970
<b>T-Tama!</b>

10:20.240 --> 10:22.690
<b>Are the rumors true?</b>

10:22.690 --> 10:25.600
<b>Aoi is so full of secrets... 
I can't help but wonder.</b>

10:26.020 --> 10:27.600
<b>Hmm...</b>

10:33.450 --> 10:34.610
<b>Sure, I like her.</b>

10:36.210 --> 10:37.860
<b>So it's true?!</b>

10:37.860 --> 10:40.250
<b>As a friend.</b>

10:40.250 --> 10:41.560
<b>Oh.</b>

10:41.560 --> 10:45.580
<b>I see... You're into love and romance, huh?</b>

10:45.580 --> 10:47.830
<b>N-No I'm not!</b>

10:48.340 --> 10:50.330
<b>There's no one you like?</b>

10:50.330 --> 10:52.880
<b>No! And I wouldn't tell you if I did!</b>

10:52.880 --> 10:55.580
<b>Ah, so there <i>is</i> someone. Who is it?</b>

10:55.580 --> 10:56.840
<b>Hey!</b>

10:57.120 --> 10:59.090
<b>Don't go thinking I'm 
interested in someone!</b>

10:59.420 --> 11:00.820
<b>Hmm...</b>

11:01.340 --> 11:04.350
<b>After-school strategy meetings... 
Just the two of you...</b>

11:04.860 --> 11:06.350
<b>Pretty fishy.</b>

11:06.600 --> 11:10.120
<b>No, it isn't! And it would 
never be Tomozaki, anyway!</b>

11:10.120 --> 11:14.610
<b>Y-You don't have to deny 
it quite so vehemently...</b>

11:14.610 --> 11:16.250
<b>I-I'm sorry!</b>

11:16.250 --> 11:18.020
<b>No, no. I get it.</b>

11:17.460 --> 11:20.710
<b>Man, you two are a riot!</b>

11:22.240 --> 11:23.370
<b>Tama!</b>

11:23.370 --> 11:25.140
<b>I'm here!</b>

11:25.760 --> 11:28.100
<b>Oh, Takahiro's with you today?</b>

11:28.100 --> 11:29.200
<b>Yo.</b>

11:29.200 --> 11:31.870
<b>Why? What's going on here?!</b>

11:33.420 --> 11:34.380
<b>What?</b>

11:34.380 --> 11:37.880
<b>I <i>see</i>! They're both protecting you, eh?</b>

11:37.880 --> 11:40.210
<b>Aren't <i>you</i> the smooth operator, Tama!</b>

11:40.210 --> 11:41.880
<b>A beauty on each arm!</b>

11:41.880 --> 11:44.890
<b>Is it still "a beauty" when it's two guys?</b>

11:44.890 --> 11:46.290
<b>I don't think so.</b>

11:46.290 --> 11:49.140
<b>It's not?! Then what is it?</b>

11:49.520 --> 11:52.160
<b>A knight on each arm? Something like that.</b>

11:52.160 --> 11:54.440
<b>That might work for <i>you</i>,</b>

11:54.440 --> 11:57.400
<b>but I don't see myself 
as a beauty <i>or</i> a knight.</b>

11:57.840 --> 12:03.000
<b>Not that again! C'mon, 
you can be plenty cool.</b>

12:03.000 --> 12:05.780
<b>Have some confidence for once, wouldya?!</b>

12:05.780 --> 12:07.280
<b>S-Sure...</b>

12:07.280 --> 12:11.290
<b>It makes me all sad to see you 
down on yourself all the time.</b>

12:11.510 --> 12:13.790
<b>I was kind of thinking that too.</b>

12:14.010 --> 12:17.200
<b>Yeah, you do tend to do that, Fumiya...</b>

12:17.200 --> 12:19.050
<b>I-I do, huh?</b>

12:19.340 --> 12:23.050
<b>Okay, Brain! Minami Nanami 
expects great things from you!</b>

12:23.050 --> 12:25.390
<b>I'll do my best...</b>

12:25.390 --> 12:27.430
<b>Wait—why are we talking about <i>me</i>?!</b>

12:31.510 --> 12:34.050
<b>Okay, we're headed home.</b>

12:34.050 --> 12:35.660
<b>You two are staying?</b>

12:35.660 --> 12:37.760
<b>We've got work after this.</b>

12:37.760 --> 12:39.690
<b>And some time to kill.</b>

12:39.690 --> 12:41.440
<b>Thanks for today.</b>

12:41.780 --> 12:42.500
<b>Sure.</b>

12:42.500 --> 12:43.570
<b>See you tomorrow.</b>

12:44.820 --> 12:45.910
<b>So anyway...</b>

12:45.910 --> 12:49.410
<b>I'm glad Tama stopped fighting 
with Erika. It's the right move.</b>

12:49.700 --> 12:55.670
<b>If she kept that up, she'd practically be giving 
the class free reign to come after her.</b>

12:56.010 --> 13:00.160
<b>And all it takes is a shallow excuse 
for "attacks" to become "punishment."</b>

13:00.820 --> 13:03.170
<b>You see that a lot online.</b>

13:03.530 --> 13:05.550
<b>So what's the next move?</b>

13:05.550 --> 13:07.500
<b>You're making headway in character creation,</b>

13:07.500 --> 13:12.030
<b>are you thinking of ways to break 
down the walls she's put up</b>

13:12.030 --> 13:13.930
<b>between her and the rest of the class?</b>

13:13.930 --> 13:19.180
<b>Mmm, it'd be nice to come up with a 
cut-and-dried way to make it all better...</b>

13:19.700 --> 13:22.820
<b>The key is being able to 
get in a lot of practice</b>

13:22.820 --> 13:25.450
<b>in a setting where it's okay to fail.</b>

13:25.660 --> 13:29.730
<b>True enough. Gotta have that safety net.</b>

13:30.200 --> 13:32.950
<b>Should I invite Takei next time?</b>

13:33.530 --> 13:34.480
<b>Takei?</b>

13:34.480 --> 13:37.460
<b>She can mess up with him 
as much as she wants.</b>

13:38.170 --> 13:39.460
<b>Oh!</b>

13:39.460 --> 13:41.340
<b>Takei 
Read: Right 
Takei: I'm off to bed!! 
Read: OK</b>

13:39.760 --> 13:41.340
<b>I'll let him know.</b>

13:41.340 --> 13:44.960
<b>But you gotta keep things simple with Takei.</b>

13:44.960 --> 13:48.410
<b>I'll just say we want him to cheer Tama up.</b>

13:48.410 --> 13:50.600
<b>And <i>don't</i> tell Shuji.</b>

13:51.760 --> 13:55.890
<b>Tama plus Shuji equals conflict 
waiting to happen.</b>

13:56.370 --> 14:00.310
<b>We're better off keeping our 
support for Tama under wraps.</b>

14:00.310 --> 14:02.900
<b>Ooh, right.</b>

14:02.900 --> 14:08.280
<b>I could wind up with a target on my 
back just for helping out like this.</b>

14:08.850 --> 14:11.610
<b>You're something else, Mizusawa.</b>

14:11.610 --> 14:12.780
<b>What d'you mean?</b>

14:12.780 --> 14:15.430
<b>It's just... you're a good guy.</b>

14:15.430 --> 14:19.040
<b>You can do everything, but you're never mean.</b>

14:20.160 --> 14:21.540
<b>I don't know about that.</b>

14:22.330 --> 14:24.920
<b>You'll find that I'm 
actually quite the schemer.</b>

14:25.200 --> 14:26.840
<b>R-Really?</b>

14:26.840 --> 14:29.840
<b>Like how I came to check on you two earlier.</b>

14:30.380 --> 14:33.600
<b>I did it in part because I was 
hoping Aoi would be there.</b>

14:34.760 --> 14:40.570
<b>Me, I'm just another guy 
doing what he wants.</b>

14:40.570 --> 14:44.180
<b>A certain someone once told 
me that was the way to go.</b>

14:46.000 --> 14:48.010
<b>Oh...</b>

14:50.350 --> 14:51.030
<b>I mean,</b>

14:51.360 --> 14:55.660
<b>even if what you're doing 
goes against my own policy,</b>

14:55.920 --> 14:57.910
<b>I don't have the right to stop you.</b>

14:58.480 --> 15:02.540
<b>This is about trying to change Tama, right?</b>

15:02.850 --> 15:07.300
<b>If it's what Hanabi herself 
wants, my hands are tied.</b>

15:07.530 --> 15:11.300
<b>All I can do is see my own methods through.</b>

15:13.790 --> 15:15.850
<b>We'll suspend these meetings 
for the time being.</b>

15:16.650 --> 15:19.810
<b>They'll resume once the 
situation has improved.</b>

15:26.190 --> 15:29.820
<b>Konno's harassment continued 
as usual that day.</b>

15:30.820 --> 15:32.990
<b>Bumping into Tama's desk,</b>

15:34.390 --> 15:37.700
<b>trash-talking Tama with her 
minions so as to be overheard...</b>

15:40.060 --> 15:42.370
<b>And Tama kept on putting up with it.</b>

15:42.910 --> 15:47.800
<b>The class's mood became even 
more sympathetic toward her.</b>

15:48.720 --> 15:50.670
<b>But what had me even more curious...</b>

15:50.970 --> 15:52.540
<b>was what Hinami was doing.</b>

15:54.060 --> 15:57.930
<b>During every break period, she'd 
casually chat with Mao Kamimae,</b>

15:57.930 --> 16:00.290
<b>one of Konno's girls.</b>

16:04.120 --> 16:07.710
<b>Takei said he'd join us 
after soccer practice.</b>

16:07.710 --> 16:11.610
<b>He's a real dum-dum, so don't 
feel too uptight around him.</b>

16:11.840 --> 16:14.320
<b>In some ways, he's a little like you.</b>

16:14.320 --> 16:16.380
<b>What? We're nothing alike!</b>

16:16.380 --> 16:18.620
<b>No, he's right.</b>

16:18.990 --> 16:20.560
<b>Don't take his side!</b>

16:20.560 --> 16:25.000
<b>He says exactly what's on his 
mind. I'm the same way, too.</b>

16:26.820 --> 16:27.720
<b>But you know...</b>

16:28.430 --> 16:31.370
<b>Takei's always been a 
key member of our class.</b>

16:31.370 --> 16:33.970
<b>What's so different between him and us?</b>

16:33.970 --> 16:36.940
<b>Could be any number of things, but a big one</b>

16:36.940 --> 16:39.470
<b>is whether the group is used to you.</b>

16:39.990 --> 16:41.600
<b>Used to...?</b>

16:41.600 --> 16:45.070
<b>Remember when we were choosing 
our sports tournament event,</b>

16:45.070 --> 16:47.110
<b>and Takei wanted to do soccer?</b>

16:47.650 --> 16:52.850
<b>Everyone just rolled with it 
all, "Oh, <i>this</i> idiot again."</b>

16:53.690 --> 16:55.910
<b>But with Tama...</b>

16:57.140 --> 17:01.480
<b>Right... Even though she was just 
naming her choice of event too...</b>

17:01.480 --> 17:03.790
<b>the mood got a little weird when she did it.</b>

17:04.250 --> 17:08.140
<b>Yeah, and Minmi came to my rescue.</b>

17:09.460 --> 17:12.530
<b>Takei has this certain charm, right?</b>

17:12.530 --> 17:14.930
<b>And that's a big part of his character.</b>

17:15.590 --> 17:20.390
<b>But Tama can be a little prickly, 
and her charm doesn't come across.</b>

17:21.240 --> 17:24.750
<b>I'm not sure about all that...</b>

17:24.750 --> 17:26.640
<b>How am I supposed to be charming?</b>

17:28.720 --> 17:33.900
<b>Charm is about having a 
consistent vulnerability.</b>

17:33.900 --> 17:36.100
<b>A consistent vulnerability?</b>

17:36.100 --> 17:38.160
<b>For example... let's see...</b>

17:38.650 --> 17:41.410
<b>Liking cheese too much, say.</b>

17:41.780 --> 17:42.620
<b>Ah!</b>

17:43.030 --> 17:44.370
<b>Like Aoi?</b>

17:44.760 --> 17:49.460
<b>She's very obvious about her 
lust for cheese: innocent,</b>

17:49.460 --> 17:52.350
<b>but with an almost exaggerated zeal.</b>

17:52.350 --> 17:57.750
<b>The people around her say, "Oh, that 
Aoi," and it becomes part of her charm.</b>

17:57.750 --> 17:58.890
<b>I see...</b>

17:58.890 --> 18:02.260
<b>I wonder if she does that on purpose.</b>

18:02.630 --> 18:04.120
<b>Who can say?</b>

18:04.120 --> 18:06.780
<b>Either way, it's food for thought, right?</b>

18:07.230 --> 18:08.520
<b>Sorry!</b>

18:08.970 --> 18:10.520
<b>I'm so—</b>

18:10.520 --> 18:12.260
<b>late!</b>

18:14.100 --> 18:16.780
<b>See? All charm, this one.</b>

18:17.890 --> 18:19.660
<b>Sorry, Tama!</b>

18:19.940 --> 18:22.090
<b>I wish I could've done something to help!</b>

18:22.090 --> 18:24.270
<b>Thanks for thinking of me, though.</b>

18:24.270 --> 18:27.040
<b>I wanted to stop her, but 
I didn't have the guts.</b>

18:27.040 --> 18:29.370
<b>I get that. Konno's scary!</b>

18:29.630 --> 18:31.230
<b>She sure is!</b>

18:31.230 --> 18:34.420
<b>But I think you're totally 
in the right here, Tama.</b>

18:34.420 --> 18:36.420
<b>Oh, yeah? Thanks.</b>

18:36.420 --> 18:40.180
<b>Don't thank me! I'm apologizing here!</b>

18:41.210 --> 18:42.520
<b>It's fine, it's fine!</b>

18:42.520 --> 18:45.940
<b>At least you've got people in your corner!</b>

18:45.940 --> 18:49.440
<b>Me, Yuko... Sakura was 
worried about you, too!</b>

18:50.000 --> 18:51.940
<b>Yuko? Sakura?</b>

18:52.220 --> 18:54.940
<b>Yuko Ueda and Sakura Kashiwazaki.</b>

18:55.210 --> 18:59.950
<b>Heck, even Mao was just telling 
Erika, "Rein it in, girl!"</b>

19:00.210 --> 19:01.890
<b>Um...</b>

19:01.890 --> 19:02.950
<b>Who's Mao?</b>

19:02.950 --> 19:06.580
<b>Mao! Mao Kamimae, Erika's pal!</b>

19:06.580 --> 19:08.030
<b>Really?</b>

19:08.030 --> 19:09.580
<b>Really!</b>

19:09.870 --> 19:12.000
<b>Can I ask you something, Tama?</b>

19:12.000 --> 19:12.580
<b>What is it?</b>

19:12.950 --> 19:16.340
<b>You're not really interested 
in your classmates, are you?</b>

19:17.840 --> 19:21.940
<b>Their names weren't ringing any bells.</b>

19:21.940 --> 19:23.540
<b>I was the same way.</b>

19:23.540 --> 19:26.720
<b>I couldn't care less about any of them.</b>

19:26.720 --> 19:29.510
<b>But once I started talking 
with all sorts of people,</b>

19:29.510 --> 19:32.980
<b>I saw that they all had their 
own thoughts and concerns.</b>

19:33.520 --> 19:36.410
<b>I gradually started taking an interest 
in people other than myself,</b>

19:36.410 --> 19:40.240
<b>and found myself wanting to know 
specific things about them.</b>

19:40.630 --> 19:45.990
<b>I noticed that simply asking those 
questions led to natural conversations.</b>

19:45.990 --> 19:51.120
<b>That's why I do think it's good to 
practice a cheerful speaking style,</b>

19:51.760 --> 19:55.730
<b>but more than that, I realized it's 
important to take an interest in others</b>

19:55.730 --> 19:59.130
<b>and work on accepting them.</b>

19:59.840 --> 20:00.850
<b>Yeah...</b>

20:00.850 --> 20:03.910
<b>If I don't care about my classmates...</b>

20:04.690 --> 20:06.890
<b>I can't get along with them.</b>

20:09.520 --> 20:12.520
<b>Whoa... that was awesome!</b>

20:12.520 --> 20:15.520
<b>Go, Army Boy-—Tomozaki!</b>

20:16.510 --> 20:17.520
<b>Tama!</b>

20:17.520 --> 20:19.200
<b>I'm here!</b>

20:19.680 --> 20:20.280
<b>Wait...</b>

20:20.600 --> 20:22.770
<b>Now Takei is in the mix?!</b>

20:22.770 --> 20:24.200
<b>You got that right!</b>

20:24.880 --> 20:27.200
<b>Huh? What's all this?</b>

20:27.840 --> 20:32.710
<b>It's Team Tomozaki, meeting to do 
something about Tama's situation.</b>

20:32.710 --> 20:35.710
<b>Wait, why is this <i>my</i> team?</b>

20:35.710 --> 20:39.550
<b>You started this, didn't 
you? Our fearless leader.</b>

20:39.550 --> 20:41.210
<b>Leader? I mean...</b>

20:41.210 --> 20:44.720
<b>That's our Tomozaki! Brain <i>and</i> leader!</b>

20:44.720 --> 20:47.740
<b>I don't need any more titles, 
thank you very much.</b>

20:49.240 --> 20:52.100
<b>Are you thinking about changing, Hanabi?</b>

20:52.400 --> 20:54.600
<b>Hmm? What's up, Aoi?</b>

20:54.880 --> 20:57.610
<b>Oh, sorry. I was just curious.</b>

20:59.650 --> 21:02.350
<b>I <i>am</i> thinking I'd like to change.</b>

21:02.350 --> 21:03.610
<b>I see...</b>

21:04.190 --> 21:07.240
<b>Do you think I'm better off <i>not</i> changing?</b>

21:07.680 --> 21:10.870
<b>I... I don't want you to.</b>

21:12.560 --> 21:16.670
<b>Maybe I just don't want to think 
that facing things head-on</b>

21:16.670 --> 21:18.630
<b>is the wrong thing to do.</b>

21:19.420 --> 21:20.630
<b>Hinami?</b>

21:20.860 --> 21:24.660
<b>But I can't make that decision for you.</b>

21:24.660 --> 21:26.380
<b>It's just what I want, that's all.</b>

21:27.220 --> 21:30.890
<b>Thanks for your concern, Aoi.</b>

21:31.360 --> 21:34.320
<b>But I've got Tomozaki and 
the others backing me up.</b>

21:34.320 --> 21:36.640
<b>I think I'm going to give it a solid try.</b>

21:37.110 --> 21:40.410
<b>I'm counting on you, okay? 
Just the tiniest bit, though.</b>

21:40.410 --> 21:42.810
<b>There's that excessive honesty again.</b>

21:44.910 --> 21:48.160
<b>I see. You <i>are</i> two peas in a pod.</b>

21:50.160 --> 21:51.910
<b>You've got my support, too!</b>

21:52.650 --> 21:54.370
<b>Thanks, Aoi!</b>

21:54.930 --> 21:58.590
<b>As I watched Hinami, back to 
being our perfect heroine,</b>

21:58.590 --> 22:00.990
<b>a thought popped into my head:</b>

22:01.970 --> 22:06.530
<b>Maybe the expression Hinami revealed 
when she took off her mask</b>

22:06.530 --> 22:09.900
<b>was just another mask after all.</b>
